  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilience: training and promoting sustainable environmental practices and climate-smart agriculture; developing community-based early warning and response systems. Participants are vulnerable rural smallholder households (men and women), with a special focus on women, youth and people with disabilities.</narrative>
